- Overtime and subcontractor usage;
- First-time fix rate;
- Rework and warranty cost;
- Schedule adherence;
- Safety performance;
- Branch break-even coverage.

## People

- Critical-role retention;
- Voluntary attrition;
- Open technical positions;
- Leadership vacancies;
- Employee engagement or pulse indicators.

## Exit readiness

- Carve-out financials completed;
- Separation issues resolved;
- Buyer engagement;
- Indicative and binding bids;
- Stranded-cost mitigation;
- Pension, environmental, warranty, and contract liabilities.

